<title>USA: McDonald's to open Paraguay restaurant.</title>
<headline>McDonald's to open Paraguay restaurant.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald's Corp said Wednesday it will open a restaurant in Asuncion, Paraguay's capital city, making Paraguay the 98th country to have a McDonald's.</p>
<p>The restaurant will be open Thursday, the fast food giant said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to be operating in more than 100 countries by the end of the year.</p>
<p>McDonald's shares were down 1/8 at 48-5/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
